            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"36\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\">HIGH SENSITIVITY</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"23\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">A trait, not a defect (Aron, 1997)</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"150\" width=\"460\" height=\"276\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"290\" y=\"238\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-size=\"26\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\">DEEPER PROCESSING</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"306\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">Experiences are analyzed more</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"361\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">thoroughly and linger longer</text><rect x=\"580\" y=\"150\" width=\"460\" height=\"276\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"810\" y=\"238\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-size=\"26\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\">SUBTLE AWARENESS</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"306\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">Shifts in tone, mood, and</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"361\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">environment register clearly</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"466\" width=\"460\" height=\"276\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"290\" y=\"554\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"26\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\">OVERSTIMULATION</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"622\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">Noise, crowds, and conflict</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"677\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">drain faster</text><rect x=\"580\" y=\"466\" width=\"460\" height=\"276\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"810\" y=\"554\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"26\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\">RECOVERY NEED</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"622\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">More downtime required to</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"677\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">reset</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"772\" width=\"900\" height=\"82\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"818\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"23\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">About 1 in 5 people, as the book reports it</text></svg>",
            "caption": "Four markers of a highly sensitive nervous system"
