" y=\"508\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">Forgotten by the next light</text></svg>",
            "caption": "An illustrative scenario showing load, not the trigger, deciding the reaction"
