"No reply\" is the event. The</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"677\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">rest is story</text><rect x=\"580\" y=\"466\" width=\"460\" height=\"276\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"810\" y=\"554\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"26\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\">NONLINEAR GROWTH</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"622\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">A bad evening does not erase a</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"677\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">good month</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"772\" width=\"900\" height=\"82\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"818\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"23\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">Accurate thinking, not positive thinking</text></svg>",
