            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"36\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\">THIS WEEK</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"23\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">Measure, then change one exchange</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"150\" width=\"900\" height=\"174\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"224\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-size=\"29\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\">1.</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"224\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">Start the audit today: before / after / absorbed, every</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"274\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">interaction</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"356\" width=\"900\" height=\"174\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"430\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-size=\"29\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\">2.</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"430\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">Day seven: mark what drains, what restores, what you cannot</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"480\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">affect</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"562\" width=\"900\" height=\"124\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"636\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"29\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\">3.</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"636\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">Choose one carried relationship with survivable stakes</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"718\" width=\"900\" height=\"124\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"792\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"29\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\">4.</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"792\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">Contain one conversation: picture the vessel, do not fix</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"874\" width=\"900\" height=\"124\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(59,130,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"948\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" font-size=\"29\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\">5.</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"948\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">Log it and compare with earlier entries for the same person</text></svg>",
            "caption": "Seeing the weight before you set it down"
