            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"36\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\">MINIMAL EXPLANATION</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"23\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">One sentence, one reason, then silence</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"150\" width=\"460\" height=\"622\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"290\" y=\"246\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-size=\"26\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\">OVER-EXPLAINING</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"322\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">Signals the decision is</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"384\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">negotiable</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"446\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">Hands them the script</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"508\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">Spends the energy you meant to</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"570\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">save</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"632\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">Reads as anxiety; invites</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"694\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">pushing</text><rect x=\"580\" y=\"150\" width=\"460\" height=\"622\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"810\" y=\"246\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"26\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\">THE POLICY</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"322\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">One sentence</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"384\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">One reason, only if useful to</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"446\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">them</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"508\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">Stop talking; let the silence</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"570\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">sit</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"632\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">If pushed, repeat. Add</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"694\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">nothing.</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"802\" width=\"900\" height=\"82\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"848\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"23\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">The second reason is where the negotiation starts</text></svg>",
            "caption": "Why fewer words hold the line better"
