            "type": "diagram",
            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"36\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\">REALITY PERSEVERATION</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"23\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">Two instruments for one reality</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"150\" width=\"460\" height=\"498\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"290\" y=\"246\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"26\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\">THE JOURNAL</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"322\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">Dated and factual</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"384\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">Written within the hour</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"446\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">Protects against their edits</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"508\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">Cannot be argued with</text><rect x=\"580\" y=\"150\" width=\"460\" height=\"498\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(20,184,166,0.15)\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"810\" y=\"246\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14b8a6\" font-size=\"26\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\">THE OUTSIDER</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"322\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">No stake in the outcome</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"384\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">Honest with you</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"446\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">Protects against your edits</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"508\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">\"Does this sound like</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"570\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">overreacting?\"</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"678\" width=\"900\" height=\"82\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"724\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"23\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">Then: the cognitive protection response, decided in advance</text></svg>",
            "caption": "Keeping your grip on what actually happened"
