"Arial,sans-serif\">\"You two just see this</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"677\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">differently\" is a valid answer</text><rect x=\"580\" y=\"466\" width=\"460\" height=\"276\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"810\" y=\"554\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-size=\"26\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"bold\">MY ACCOUNTABILITY?</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"622\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">Collecting villains is the</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"677\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">victim mindset with new words</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"772\" width=\"900\" height=\"82\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"818\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"23\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">For a repeated, documented pattern. Not for disagreement.</text></svg>",
