"#fff\" font-size=\"26\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">Name the grief in four lines. Trigger plan for the pull to</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"938\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"26\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\">reply.</text></svg>",
