          "content": "A map of the whole arc Chapters 11 and 12 describe, so you can locate yourself on it. Most people expect the line to go straight up after the decision. It does not. It dips through the burst, dips again through grief, and only then starts to climb. Knowing the shape in advance is most of what makes it survivable.",
