          "explanation": "The compass is an interoceptive check: a bodily read of expansion versus contraction, consulted before analysis rather than instead of it. Option A is the analytical process the book says over-givers already over-rely on. Option C outsources the decision, which is the pattern the authentic self replaces. Option D avoids the uncertainty the chapter asks you to embrace.",
